menu "Web app (webui)"

    config WEBUI_RELEASES_URL
        string "Where release channels are published"
        default "https://davidiansmith.ca/holo-player-fw/"
        help
            The documentation site, which carries each release's firmware. A channel such as
            `latest` is looked up in <this>versions.json, and its image described by
            <this><version>/firmware/manifest.json. The site's own domain, not
            daveismith.github.io: that redirects through plain http, which a pull refuses.

endmenu
